    "body": "## Motivation\n\n`test_vlm_serving_flashinfer` fails its offline throughput check (`output_throughput >= 5940`) on 5090 runners, with measurements of 5176–5939 tok/s.\n\n#43564 reserves the full remaining output for running `ignore_eos` requests during prefill admission. Those requests always generate their full `max_new_tokens`, so admission no longer discounts them by `new_token_ratio`.\n\nIn this benchmark:\n- **Workload:** 200 fixed-length requests, each about 410 input + 2048 output tokens.\n- **KV pool:** 411,675 tokens, enough for about 167 of these requests at full length.\n- **Admission:** 170 requests run at once, with no retractions. The other 30 wait in the queue and run afterwards as a small-batch tail.\n\nThis lowers offline output throughput by design.\n\nOnly offline output throughput is affected. The online phase sends 50 requests at 1 per second and stays well below the admission limit. Its medians, all within their limits:\n\n| Metric | Limit | Measured |\n|---|---|---|\n| e2e | 17480 ms | 16031–16159 ms |\n| TTFT | 83 ms | 66–77 ms |\n| ITL | 8.4 ms | 7.61–7.72 ms |\n\n## Modifications\n\nLower the floor from 5940 to 4510, using the `basic_perf` anchoring rule from #40617, worst sample / (1 + max(0.10, spread)), on 8 CI attempts on 5090 runners:\n\n`5851.86, 5831.51, 5471.16, 5295.27, 5210.99, 5175.67, 5939.31, 5918.90`\n\nThat gives a worst of 5175.67, a spread of 14.75% and a floor of 5175.67 / 1.1475 = 4510.2. Every sample clears the new floor by at least 10%.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #38203121252](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38203121252)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #38203121011](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38203121011)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #38203121067](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38203121067)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
